AltoLeverageSwapperForWrapperToken::setWhitelisted
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when isWhitelisted status is unchanged
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
    └── when isWhitelisted status changes
        ├── when setting to true
        │   ├── it should update isWhitelisted mapping
        │   └── it should emit SetWhitelisted
        └── when setting to false
            ├── it should update isWhitelisted mapping
            └── it should emit SetWhitelisted
